# AIDE SESSION

Cold-start protocol for agents reorienting on this project. This is a
snapshot of the current architectural intent and the anti-regression
invariants every build phase must hold. It is NOT historical commentary —
superseded design decisions are cut, not annotated.

## State summary (set 2026-10-10, brain authoring skill built — pausing)

Feature `brain-authoring-skill-create-a-brain-aide-for-any-backend` is built and QA passed with notes; no todo.aide.

What landed (uncommitted):

- aide_brain read-only modes per decision #26: template, contract and draft; the host read is unchanged.
